graph TB
    subgraph 用户层 [用户接入层]
        U1[浏览器<br>Gradio Web界面]
        U2[微信小程序/H5<br>gradio_client调用]
    end

    subgraph 应用层 [Gradio应用层 - Python/FastAPI]
        direction TB
        
        subgraph 网关 [网关与基础设施]
            G1[Gradio路由管理<br>gr.Blocks]
            G2[鉴权中间件<br>Token验证]
            G3[配额限流器<br>Redis/内存计数]
        end
        
        subgraph 业务 [业务模块]
            B1[简历诊断模块<br>resume_diagnosis]
            B2[模拟面试模块<br>interview_agent]
            B3[能力对标模块<br>analytics]
        end
        
        subgraph 工具 [工具层]
            T1[简历解析器<br>PyPDF2+pdfplumber]
            T2[Prompt管理器<br>prompts.yaml]
            T3[向量检索器<br>ChromaDB]
        end
    end

    subgraph AI层 [AI能力层 - 云端API]
        A1[智谱 GLM-4-Flash<br>文本生成/对话]
        A2[阿里云 qwen3.7<br>text-embedding]
    end

    subgraph 数据层 [数据存储层]
        D1[(SQLite<br>用户/记录)]
        D2[(ChromaDB<br>面试题向量库)]
        D3[(文件系统<br>上传简历PDF)]
    end

    U1 --> G1
    U2 --> G1
    G1 --> G2 --> G3
    G3 --> B1 & B2 & B3
    B1 --> T1 & T2
    B2 --> T2 & T3
    B3 --> T3
    T1 --> D3
    T2 --> A1
    T3 --> A2
    T3 --> D2
    B1 & B2 & B3 --> D1
    A1 --> A2